   "source": [
    "# Figure 5 · 模型部署流程、基准矩阵与概率校准\n",
    "\n",
    "> A：Deployment Flowchart（序列→模型→校准）\n",
    "> B：Multidimensional benchmark matrix（逐药 OOD AUROC + Brier）\n",
    "> C：Probability calibration under Subtype OOD（class level）\n",
    "> Supplementary：ESM 增益不来源于位点配对互作的 epistasis 对照。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "b7dfe335",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
